<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb Mongolian copper ore imports 7,941 T.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb Mongolian copper ore imports 7,941 T.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 7,941 tonnes of copper ore including copper concentrates from Mongolia in the first two months in 1997, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>It did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>Copper ore imports from Mongolia in February alone reached 5,918 tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China's total imports of copper ore including concentrates reached 89,826 tonnes in the January to February period.</p>
<p>Imports in February alone were 60,563 tonnes, the figures showed. -- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
